# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Student data & licensed corpora — NEVER COMMIT
#
# Two separate reasons, both hard rules:
#   1. FERPA — real student work must not enter a public repo, even de-identified.
#   2. Licensing — PERSUADE 2.0, ELLIPSE, AAC&U VALUE, and IAM are CC BY-NC-SA / NC.
#      We may develop and evaluate against them; we may not redistribute them here
#      or ship them as sample data. See docs/DATA-PLAN.md §1.
#
# Downloaded corpora live under fixtures/corpora/ and are fetched by script, never
# committed. Synthetic + permissively-licensed fixtures ARE committed (see below).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Downloaded datasets (all of them — fetch via script, never vendor)
fixtures/corpora/
fixtures/**/*.csv
fixtures/**/*.parquet
fixtures/**/*.zip
fixtures/**/*.tar.gz

# Real student work, in any form
fixtures/teacher-goldset/
fixtures/handwriting-samples/
fixtures/golden_set/*.json
!fixtures/golden_set/FORMAT.json
!fixtures/golden_set/generate_sample.py
private/
*.student.*

# Signing keys & credentials
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.p8
signing_key*

# Canvas credentials & tokens
credentials.toml
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ...but DO keep the synthetic, self-generated citation fixtures (no license, no PII)
!fixtures/citations/
!fixtures/citations/*.json
!fixtures/citations/*.md
!fixtures/citations/*.py

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build & tooling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.uv/
node_modules/
dist/
build/
target/
*.db
# WAL puts its log and shared-memory index beside the database. These don't
# match *.db, and they appear as soon as anything opens a store.
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
.worktrees/
*.log

# Generated: local Canvas sandbox ids + instance URL
fixtures/canvas_sandbox.json

# Updater manifest + signing artifacts
latest.json
*.sig
*.dmg

# Tauri build
app/src-tauri/target/
app/test-results/
app/playwright-report/
app/artifacts/
artifacts/

# Python venv in app (sidecar)
app/src-tauri/resources/

# OS artifacts
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Engine runtime state, written into the default data directory. settings.json
# holds the teacher's Canvas token; live-e2e/ is what the Canvas harness sends.
fixtures/settings.json
fixtures/live-e2e/
